RCP 1
M title Miso soup
M serves 4
M time 15
I 1|l|water
I 1|piece|kombu, postcard sized
I 15|g|bonito flakes
I 3|tbsp|miso paste
I 200|g|silken tofu, cubed
I 2||spring onions, sliced
I 1|tbsp|dried wakame
S 600
T Steep the kombu in the water as it comes
T slowly to a bare simmer, then remove it.
S 120
T Add the bonito flakes, cut the heat, and
T let them settle before straining.
S 0
T Soak the wakame in the strained dashi
T and add the tofu.
S 120
T Loosen the miso in a ladleful of broth,
T stir it back in, and warm gently without
T boiling.
S 0
T Serve with the spring onions.
